    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Input｜流程图\n按键到能力申请的时间顺序。类与接口见 [[GGYGO_结构_输入与意图.canvas|结构图]]、[[Input/结构|结构文档]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "action",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. Enhanced Input 发出 InputAction 轴值或按下/松开。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "map",
